WEBVTT

00:01.440 --> 00:10.500
Several days later, the imperial decree arrived: you were cleared of all guilt, while the rebellious officer Chu Huan was sentenced to be beheaded in accordance with law.

00:11.040 --> 00:17.500
That same year, Prince of Ning Sikong Zheng married the eldest daughter of the Chen clan, consolidating his position as undisputed heir to the throne.

00:18.000 --> 00:26.500
Weary of court struggles, you shuttered your manor gates, declining all visitors and remaining aloof from political affairs.
